    "detailed_description": "TRAXION 3000 is a cave-flyer set in outer space. Explore the underground caves of 6 different alien planet, fight enemies, and solve puzzles using your ship's tractor beam and laser cannons. Can you retrieve all cargo pods, rescue the stranded astronauts, and make it out alive? This is the third entry in the TRAXION series and the main innovation here is that you can manipulate EVERYTHING in the game world with your tractor beam. Also new is a multiplayer mode where you can play with up to 4 players in coop and deathmatch mode.",
